# Canonical strategy: Strategy A (self-referencing) — each locale canonicalizes to its own URL.
# See seo.jsx > buildCanonical(). No GlobalCanonical component — each page handles its own Helmet.
# Domain: no-www (aerova.asia). No prerender yet (vite-plugin-ssg, HIGH priority backlog item).

# www → no-www — must be first, ! required so static files don't bypass it
https://www.aerova.asia/* https://aerova.asia/:splat 301!

# Trailing slash normalization — ! required for same reason
# Cloudflare Pages does not support catch-all regex, so routes are listed explicitly
